  <Strings>
    <Section>s0-0</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>982</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Tytree&gt;兄ちゃん、
がんばってきてね！
</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Boa sorte, &lt;Tytree&gt;!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1007</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>セレーナさんは、
僕たちのあこがれのマトなんだ！
</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Todos nós admiramos a Selena!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1029</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>セレーナさんを
助けてあげて！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Então, por favor, salve ela!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1093</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Tytree&gt;兄ちゃん、
帰ってきたの？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Você voltou pra casa, &lt;Tytree&gt;?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1115</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>また、行っちゃうの……？
つまんないの……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>O quê, você vai embora de novo?
Que chato...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1140</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Tytree&gt;兄ちゃんを
連れてっちゃヤだー!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Não leve o &lt;Tytree&gt; com você!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1208</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Tytree&gt;さん、
おはようございます！
</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Bom dia, senhor &lt;Tytree&gt;!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1230</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>と、父ちゃんが
い、いつもお世話に……
</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>V-Você sempre cuida do
meu pai...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1317</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>また、旅に出るの？
</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Você vai embora de novo?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1339</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>帰ってきたら、
遊んでよ！
</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Brinca comigo quando
voltar, tá?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1374</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Tytree&gt;兄ちゃんを
よろしくお願いします！
</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Divirtam-se com o &lt;Tytree&gt;!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1396</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ちょっとうるさいけど、
面白い人だよ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ele é meio chato,
mas é muito engraçado!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1421</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Tytree&gt;兄ちゃんの家？
その階段の右側のところだよ。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>A casa do &lt;Tytree&gt;? É aquela
perto da escada.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1443</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>でもこの時間は
工場で働いてるんじゃないかな？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Mas acho que ele deve estar
trabalhando na fábrica
agora.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1465</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>行ってみたら？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Por que não vão procurar lá?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1529</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>最近、街の雰囲気が
少し悪いんだ。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>As coisas andam ruins
por aqui ultimamente.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1551</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Tytree&gt;兄ちゃん、
早く帰ってきて！
</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Então, por favor, volte
logo, &lt;Tytree&gt;!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1576</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>最近、ガジュマのお友達が
増えたんだ。
</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Fiz muitos amigos Gajuma
ultimamente.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1598</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>でもみんな、自分たちの街を
追い出されたみたいで、
なんかピリピリしてるよ……
</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Mas todos eles são tão tensos...
Parece que foram todos expulsos
das suas cidades antigas.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1620</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>やっぱりこの街は
&lt;Tytree&gt;兄ちゃんがいないと
ダメなんだ。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Esta cidade não é a mesma
sem o &lt;Tytree&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1684</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Tytree&gt;お兄ちゃん、
どうしたら、お兄ちゃんたちみたいに
ヒューマとガジュマ、うまくやれるの？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Tytree&gt;, como posso ser mais
como você? Quero me dar bem
com Huma e Gajuma também.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1706</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ガジュマのお友達も
ヒューマとなんか仲良くしちゃ
ダメって言うんだ。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Meus amigos Gajuma disseram
que nunca vão se dar bem
com os Huma.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>27</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1731</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>僕、ヒューマとも
ガジュマとも仲良くしたいんだ。
</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Eu quero ser amigo
dos Huma.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1753</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>だってこれまで、
それが普通だったし……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Achei que isso era normal...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>29</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1775</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>でも……そっちの方が
間違ってるのかな……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Mas agora não tenho certeza...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>30</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1839</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ゴメンね、&lt;Tytree&gt;お兄ちゃん……
ヒューマと仲良くすると、
仲間外れにされちゃうんだ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Desculpa, &lt;Tytree&gt;...
Me zoam quando tento me
dar bem com os Huma...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>31</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1861</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ゴメンね……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Desculpa...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>32</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1899</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ねえ、おじちゃん、
ガジュマとヒューマが仲良くするのって
やっぱりおかしいの？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ei, moço, não é estranho
Huma e Gajuma serem amigos?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>33</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1921</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>僕がおかしいの……？
僕、どうすればいいのかな……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Será que eu sou estranho...?
O que devo fazer...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>34</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1946</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……僕……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Eu...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>35</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1968</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>…………</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>36</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2016</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なんか最近、
少し街の雰囲気がよくなったよ。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Acho que as coisas têm
melhorado por aqui.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>37</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2038</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>このあいだ、来た
女の人のおかげだな……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Deve ser graças àquela
moça que passou por aqui...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>38</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2063</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>工場の大人たちが
少しもめてるみたい。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Parece que os adultos da
fábrica não estão se
entendendo...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>39</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2085</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なんでケンカするのかな……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Por que será que estão brigando?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>40</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2124</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ねえ……ねえ……
大丈夫なの……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>E-Ei... Você tá bem...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>41</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2188</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>みんな、
&lt;Tytree&gt;兄ちゃんを
必要としてるんだ。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Todos precisam de você, &lt;Tytree&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>42</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2210</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>旅が終わったら、
絶対帰ってきてよ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Então volte pra casa quando
sua jornada terminar, tá?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>43</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2232</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そのまま、
どっか行っちゃわないでよ。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Você não pode ir embora assim...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>44</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2257</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ガジュマとヒューマのケンカは
おさまったけど……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Gajuma e Huma não brigam
tanto quanto antes, mas...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>45</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2279</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>まだ少し
ギクシャクしてるんだ。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ainda tá um pouco estranho.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>46</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2304</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>オレはカレギア最強の
鉄工職人になるんダッ!!
</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Quando crescer, vou ser o
melhor ferreiro de toda
Callegea!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>47</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2326</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>…………
</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>48</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2348</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……いや……なれって父ちゃんに
言われたし……
</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ah... Hum... bem, é o que
meu pai quer que eu faça...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>49</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Strings>
</SceneText>
